<title>FINLAND: Finnish paper union to not join broad '98 pay deal.</title>
<headline>Finnish paper union to not join broad '98 pay deal.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish Paper Workers' Union congress on Wednesday adopted a resoluion saying it would be impossible for paper workers to join a potential nationwide comprehensive pay deal from 1998.</p>
<p>&quot;It is impossible for the Paper Workers' Union to be part of a new potential incomes settlement,&quot; the resolution said.</p>
<p>A union official told a Reuters reporter that the congress had approved the resolution.</p>
</text>
